From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 22:56:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Test-only host harness for the WorkshopUse Grant
 (02-rights)

Runs the real permutation_frontier::dispatch natively over hand-built
accounts. Under cfg(test) only: init's CPIs go to a minimal System
program that checks signers, PDA seeds and with-seed addresses
(host_test.rs), and prologue::now / init::rent read a per-thread clock
and the rent formula, since on a host target solana_program's CPI is a
no-op and Clock/Rent are unsupported. SBF builds are unchanged.

24 tests: legitimate use with exact conservation, the grantee's session,
the issuer's wallet-only issue, and refusals for no grant, another
person, another facility or station, another season, expiry, revocation,
quota, double use, concurrent requests, stale generation or owner,
forged Grant accounts and raw direct calls; reserve-then-revoke versus
unused-quota revoke; all-or-nothing shortfalls; close.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
